### Key changes summary:

**`ChatIntelliSense.vue`:**
- Added `selectedItems` array in `data()` to track multi-selected suggestions
- Added checkbox input on each suggestion row
- `toggleSelected(s)` — adds/removes item from selection by unique key
- `onItemClick` — if items already selected or Shift/Ctrl held, toggles selection; otherwise single-selects
- `itemClass(s, i)` — highlights selected rows distinctly from the active (focused) row  
- "Add all" button appears in the header when items are selected, emitting `accept-multi`
- Keyboard hint updated to show `Space` = select
- `selectedItems` resets when `suggestions` changes

**`Chat.vue`:**
- Added `@accept-multi="onIntelliSenseAcceptMulti"` on `<ChatIntelliSense>`
- `onIntelliSenseAcceptMulti(items)` — bulk-adds files and/or inserts mention text for all selected items at once
- Added `ArrowUp`/`ArrowDown` keyboard navigation in `onChatInputKeyDown`
- Added `Ctrl+Space` to toggle selection of the currently focused suggestion via `$refs.intelliSense.toggleSelected()`

The issue is that hover effects change the element size (border appearing/disappearing causes layout shift). Fix by using consistent sizing with `ring` instead of `border`, and use `opacity`/`bg` transitions without size-affecting properties.

