### Key fixes:

- **Fixed height `h-6`** on every row — hover/selection state changes never affect element height
- **`ring-1 ring-transparent`** base on all rows — the ring slot is always reserved, so toggling `ring-info/60` adds no layout shift (unlike `border` which adds 1px)
- **`flex-none` on icons/badges** — prevents any flex children from resizing on state change  
- **`w-10` placeholder** on the `↵ Tab` hint — space is always reserved, text just appears/disappears
- **Separate `hoveredIndex`** tracked locally — soft `bg-base-300/60` on hover vs stronger `bg-info/30` for keyboard-active, so they're visually distinct without size changes
- **`transition-colors`** only — no `transition-all` which could animate size/padding

